{"4069410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Our Blood Ties", "steam_appid": 4069410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Our Blood Ties</strong> is a psychological horror game where you take on the role of a police officer investigating an abandoned house. In this house, you will find the ghosts of the family that used to live there and you will discover each of their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world of twisted memories as you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delve into the minds of the ghosts</strong> as they reveal their past to you through distorted worlds.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069410/extras/55ccb70d07de00827816f9242d216008.poster.avif?t=1788007996\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069410/extras/55ccb70d07de00827816f9242d216008.webm?t=1788007996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069410/extras/55ccb70d07de00827816f9242d216008.mp4?t=1788007996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Communicate directly with the dead</strong> and ask questions that uncover hidden truths about the family's dark past, making them reveal information that helps you progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069410/extras/c05b9998038534880bd71ef1d275f9b2.poster.avif?t=1788007996\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069410/extras/c05b9998038534880bd71ef1d275f9b2.webm?t=1788007996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069410/extras/c05b9998038534880bd71ef1d275f9b2.mp4?t=1788007996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve environmental puzzles</strong> to progress deeper into the house and its mysteries, with some puzzles involving interacting with the supernatural and other puzzles requiring you to overcome the physics-defying worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069410/extras/ee07eab5391dd856a857af9d0cb4fd49.poster.avif?t=1788007996\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069410/extras/ee07eab5391dd856a857af9d0cb4fd49.webm?t=1788007996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069410/extras/ee07eab5391dd856a857af9d0cb4fd49.mp4?t=1788007996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the story</strong> and piece together buried memories to discover the truth behind a family torn apart by one defining event.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069410/extras/59784a5e9ae47e8c6e40d3904d84b664.poster.avif?t=1788007996\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069410/extras/59784a5e9ae47e8c6e40d3904d84b664.webm?t=1788007996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069410/extras/59784a5e9ae47e8c6e40d3904d84b664.mp4?t=1788007996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the chase</strong> as spirits pursue you through twisted hallways and eerie environments while you search for hiding spots.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069410/extras/bf21dabe80a4284c78db1602f0e74d9e.poster.avif?t=1788007996\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069410/extras/bf21dabe80a4284c78db1602f0e74d9e.webm?t=1788007996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069410/extras/bf21dabe80a4284c78db1602f0e74d9e.mp4?t=1788007996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Our Blood Ties</strong> is a psychological horror game where you take on the role of a police officer investigating an abandoned house. In this house, you will find the ghosts of the family that used to live there and you will discover each of their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world of twisted memories as you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delve into the minds of the ghosts</strong> as they reveal their past to you through distorted worlds.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069410/extras/55ccb70d07de00827816f9242d216008.poster.avif?t=1788007996\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069410/extras/55ccb70d07de00827816f9242d216008.webm?t=1788007996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069410/extras/55ccb70d07de00827816f9242d216008.mp4?t=1788007996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Communicate directly with the dead</strong> and ask questions that uncover hidden truths about the family's dark past, making them reveal information that helps you progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069410/extras/c05b9998038534880bd71ef1d275f9b2.poster.avif?t=1788007996\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069410/extras/c05b9998038534880bd71ef1d275f9b2.webm?t=1788007996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069410/extras/c05b9998038534880bd71ef1d275f9b2.mp4?t=1788007996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve environmental puzzles</strong> to progress deeper into the house and its mysteries, with some puzzles involving interacting with the supernatural and other puzzles requiring you to overcome the physics-defying worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069410/extras/ee07eab5391dd856a857af9d0cb4fd49.poster.avif?t=1788007996\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069410/extras/ee07eab5391dd856a857af9d0cb4fd49.webm?t=1788007996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069410/extras/ee07eab5391dd856a857af9d0cb4fd49.mp4?t=1788007996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the story</strong> and piece together buried memories to discover the truth behind a family torn apart by one defining event.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"